docs {
  # Create Volunteer
  
  Creates a new volunteer work block for your profile. This endpoint uses the batch update system, so you can create multiple volunteer experiences in a single request.
  
  ## Request Body
  
  The request uses the batch update format with a `creations` array. Each creation object contains:
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `block_type` | string | ✅ | Must be `"volunteer"` |
  | `section_name` | string | ❌ | Section name (e.g., "volunteer", "community-service") |
  | `sort_order` | number | ❌ | Order within section (0 = first) |
  | `data` | object | ✅ | Volunteer data (see below) |
  
  ### Volunteer Data Fields
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `organization_name` | string | ✅ | Organization name (max 255 chars) |
  | `role` | string | ✅ | Volunteer role/title (max 255 chars) |
  | `cause` | string | ❌ | Cause or focus area (e.g., "Education", "Environment", "Health") (max 255 chars) |
  | `start_date` | string | ❌ | Start date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format |
  | `end_date` | string | ❌ | End date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format |
  | `is_current` | boolean | ❌ | Whether currently volunteering (default: `false`) |
  | `description` | string | ❌ | Description of volunteer work |
  | `highlights` | array | ❌ | Array of achievements or highlights |
  
  ## Example: Current Volunteer Position
  
  ```json
  {
    "creations": [
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "sort_order": 0,
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Code for Good",
          "role": "Mentor",
          "cause": "Education",
          "start_date": "2023-06-01",
          "is_current": true,
          "description": "Mentoring aspiring developers from underrepresented communities, providing guidance on career development and technical skills.",
          "highlights": [
            "Mentored 15+ students",
            "Organized monthly coding workshops",
            "Helped 5 students land their first tech jobs"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "updates": [],
    "deletions": []
  }
  ```
  
  ## Example: Past Volunteer Experience
  
  ```json
  {
    "creations": [
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "sort_order": 0,
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Habitat for Humanity",
          "role": "Construction Volunteer",
          "cause": "Housing",
          "start_date": "2021-03-15",
          "end_date": "2022-11-30",
          "is_current": false,
          "description": "Participated in building homes for families in need, contributing over 200 hours of volunteer work.",
          "highlights": [
            "Completed 200+ volunteer hours",
            "Assisted in building 3 homes",
            "Led volunteer orientation sessions"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "updates": [],
    "deletions": []
  }
  ```
  
  ## Example: Environmental Volunteer
  
  ```json
  {
    "creations": [
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "sort_order": 0,
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Ocean Cleanup Initiative",
          "role": "Event Coordinator",
          "cause": "Environment",
          "start_date": "2022-05-01",
          "end_date": "2023-08-31",
          "is_current": false,
          "description": "Organized beach cleanup events and educational workshops on marine conservation.",
          "highlights": [
            "Organized 12 cleanup events",
            "Collected 500+ pounds of waste",
            "Educated 200+ participants"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "updates": [],
    "deletions": []
  }
  ```
  
  ## Example: Multiple Volunteer Experiences
  
  You can create multiple volunteer experiences in a single request:
  
  ```json
  {
    "creations": [
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "sort_order": 0,
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Local Animal Shelter",
          "role": "Dog Walker",
          "cause": "Animal Welfare",
          "start_date": "2023-01-10",
          "is_current": true,
          "description": "Regularly walk and socialize shelter dogs to help them find forever homes.",
          "highlights": [
            "Walked 50+ dogs",
            "Helped 10 dogs get adopted"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "sort_order": 1,
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Tech for Seniors",
          "role": "Technology Instructor",
          "cause": "Education",
          "start_date": "2022-09-01",
          "end_date": "2023-05-31",
          "is_current": false,
          "description": "Taught basic computer and smartphone skills to senior citizens.",
          "highlights": [
            "Taught 30+ seniors",
            "Created beginner-friendly curriculum"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "updates": [],
    "deletions": []
  }
  ```
  
  ## Example: Minimal Volunteer Entry
  
  Only `organization_name` and `role` are required:
  
  ```json
  {
    "creations": [
      {
        "block_type": "volunteer",
        "section_name": "volunteer",
        "data": {
          "organization_name": "Community Center",
          "role": "Tutor"
        }
      }
    ],
    "updates": [],
    "deletions": []
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response (200 OK)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Version updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "version": {
        "id": 11,
        "version_number": 11,
        "created_at": "2024-01-16T15:00:00Z"
      },
      "created_blocks": [107],
      "updated_blocks": [],
      "deleted_blocks": []
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  
  - Both `organization_name` and `role` are required fields
  - Dates must be in `YYYY-MM-DD` format
  - If `is_current` is `true`, `end_date` is not required
  - Common causes include: "Education", "Environment", "Health", "Housing", "Animal Welfare", "Hunger Relief", "Community Development", etc.
  - Arrays (`highlights`) default to empty arrays if not provided
  - Volunteer work demonstrates community involvement and can complement professional experience
  - Each request creates a new version, preserving history
}

